# Tenth District Hero ({1}{W}, 2/3 Human): "{1}{W}, Collect evidence 2: This creature becomes a Human Detective with base power and toughness
# 4/4 and gains vigilance." and "{2}{W}, Collect evidence 4: If this creature is a Detective, it becomes a legendary creature named
# Mileva, the Stalwart, it has base power and toughness 5/5, and it gains "Other creatures you control have indestructible."" (CR 701.59a,
# 613.4, 205.1a, 205.4, 201.3). Bot1 discards Griselbrand and Hill Giant to Faithless Looting on turn 3, exiles Hill Giant (mana value 4) for
# the first ability: the Hero is a 4/4 Human Detective with vigilance, name unchanged, the Memnite not indestructible. Then Black Lotus's WWW
# and Griselbrand (8) pay for the second: Mileva, the Stalwart, 5/5, legendary, the Memnite indestructible and Mileva herself not.

